# ============================================
# DATABASE CONFIGURATION (NeonDB)
# ============================================

# NeonDB Connection URL - Get this from your Neon dashboard
# Use the POOLED connection string for serverless environments
# For Vercel: Add this in Vercel Dashboard → Project Settings → Environment Variables
